n2 [label="Campus Transport\l• Bus code / series → route → destination campus\l• Pickup points and alternative buses to the same campus\l• Daily rotating bus QR: scan → sign in → choose numbered seat\l• One seat per rider; prevent duplicate seat claims\l• Seated / standing check-in; remaining seat count\l• Check-out releases seat; reservations are separate\l• Drivers, students or staff may contribute GPS with consent\l• OpenStreetMap + Leaflet; last-update time and GPS accuracy\l• Stale / offline status; no report means unknown, not cancelled\l• QR screen or fresh print daily; copied QR is not proof of presence\l• Browser GPS needs HTTPS, permission and connectivity\l• Foreground updates only; locked-screen tracking is not guaranteed\l",color="#13786c",fontcolor="#263345"];
n1 -> n2;
